{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":13,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-6","storyName":"“复仇于我”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"车祸当晚，红与子月的厮杀意外导致索默尔的卡车与莱昂图索的轿车相撞。看见几次三番出现在自己眼前的红，怒上心头的柳德米拉独自追了上去。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":11,"next":13,"characters":["索默尔","柳德米拉","卡车司机","家族成员","卡车司机A","卡车司机B","？？？","英格丽","子月","红"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"animtext","id":9,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    10:17 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":10},{"type":"animtextclean","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"car","id":13},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"car","fadetime":"1","id":14},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"5","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":15},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.5","id":16},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......就是这样，柳德米拉，该说的我都跟你说了。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你帮威尼斯运的什么货？","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"今天晚上是一批轮胎。","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"基本都是载具生产会用到的耗材，源石引擎、钢件、合金之类的，有时候也有一些冻鳞冻肉酒精药品......","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"这种事情在叙拉古的其他城市很常见，家族的商品基本都不走正常的报关程序，能避很大一笔税。只不过在新沃尔西尼——","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你不用说那么多，我懂。","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"好、好。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"这不是第一次了，对吧？","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"嗯......柳德米拉，你今天晚上不跟他们去拍电影，就是因为我？","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不然呢？","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你是从什么时候发现的？","id":41},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"car","fadetime":"2","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"curtain","id":47},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkalley_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_longmendarkalley_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":51,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"你干嘛一直跟着我们？","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"不好意思，我和鲁杰罗真的很忙！可以请你离开吗？","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"忙到连喝杯咖啡的时间都没有吗？","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"哎呀，索默尔，鲁杰罗，你们的戒心太重了！","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"这里是新沃尔西尼，大家都是新沃尔西尼市民，日后相处的时间还长，彼此交流一下感情，还是很有必要的。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"这样吧，我们干脆在你们营地对面开个咖啡馆得了，那么多司机，不愁没生意，而且也方便咱们见面——","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smoke_grenade","volume":"1","id":72},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smog","layer":"1","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0.7","g":"0.7","b":"0.7","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"什么情况，咳咳——哪儿来的这么大的烟，我的眼睛都瞎了——","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"playsound","key":"$punch_n1","volume":"1","id":77},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"哎哟，*叙拉古粗口*谁打我！","id":80},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"1","id":82},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"0.21","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"哎哟喂——","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0.7","g":"0.7","b":"0.7","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"bgeffect","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"......","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"......","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"索默尔，鲁杰罗！","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我、我们什么都不知道！你也看到了，我们俩离你好几步远，我们站在原地动都没动......","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你也知道的，我们不会法术......","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"听说，这个地块之所以被划为最外围地块，在市政厅拨给我们建卡车营地之前都没有规划，就是因为这里以前是......","id":114},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"少、少扯那些没用的，这次就先饶过你们。","id":118},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.7","id":121},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#7$1","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":130},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":131},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_truckengine","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":133},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":136},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":137,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......我想起来了。","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"也就是那次你帮了我们，大家伙才慢慢和你熟起来，缠着你问那神奇的源石技艺是怎么回事，缠着你问乌萨斯的见闻......","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......家族的人找上你，自然不会只是“看你不爽”。","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"但那之后，他们还是在继续纠缠你。索默尔，你为什么没再跟我说呢？","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"伊雷妮知道吗？","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"（摇头）","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我要给小古莉治病，要接她来新沃尔西尼生活，我很需要那笔钱，柳德米拉。","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"而且说了能怎么样呢，他们是一群不达目的不罢休的恶狼，我不想给互助会的其他人添麻烦。","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"大家是生活在一起的兄弟姐妹，但这些兄弟姐妹也都只是一群再单纯不过的普通人。","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉脑海里闪过卡车司机们那一张张脸，没有接话。","id":158},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.4","fadetime":"3","id":159},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"curtain","id":164},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"喂，瞒着柳德米拉了吧？","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"放心，她在自己的帐篷里待着呢！","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"她一个新来的，来了营地之后就没摘下过那副面罩，每次皱起眉头......我反正心里怪不是滋味的。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"是啊。这几天有她在场，可憋死我了。","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"快点快点——","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_lighter","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"柳、柳德米拉......","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机A","text":"不好意思不好意思，我们马上要开夜车，想出车前抽根烟提提神来着——不提也可以的！我们马上就掐掉！","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"呃，抽烟不用特意避着我。","id":197},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"啊？","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"你的结晶不是位置比较特殊嘛......大家伙以为你戴着面罩，是因为呼吸道很脆弱什么的。司机们抽烟抽习惯了，我们就想着......","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你们想多了。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机B","text":"我们希望你能喜欢这里，柳德米拉。","id":210},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":216},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":220},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":221},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_truckengine","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":223},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"待会儿到前面的路口，你下去等我吧。快到地方了，让威尼斯的人看到我带了不相干的人，会有麻烦。","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳德米拉......","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"行了，别说那么多了。我已经上了车，今晚这一趟我会陪你走完。","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"谢谢你，柳德米拉。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"不管怎么样，幸好有你陪我。","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"哼哼♪哼哼哼♪哼~~♪","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"索默尔，从刚刚开始，这首歌你都循环了好几遍了，还没腻？","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"当然！","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"《不期而会》，多好听的歌，Sora小姐的歌声多么美妙！","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"这可是这周最热的单曲，听采访说这是Sora小姐特意为这次狂欢节录制的。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"“不期而会”，我没什么文化，但我知道这是一个好词......你不觉得它就是在讲咱们这些人吗？","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳德米拉，你会离开，对吗？","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"啊，什么？","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你说你在叙拉古已经没有任何亲人和朋友了，你没地方可去，大家都很乐意营地里以后能多一个你这样有趣的家伙。","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我和伊雷妮讨论过这件事情，我觉得，你不会一直留在卡车互助会......","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你的眼睛里有怀疑，也有恨，虽然我不知道那到底是对谁。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你还记得自己第一次看见伊雷妮时的样子吗？","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我不记得有什么特别的。","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我醒来的时候发现自己已经在营地里了，你和伊雷妮站在我面前......","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你看见伊雷妮，眼神一下子就变了......虽然很快就恢复了正常。","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你把她认成了别人，对吧？","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"curtain","id":271},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":279},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":283},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":284},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"可能是刚醒，有点恍惚。","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"鲁珀女性、红色的连帽衫、脖子上戴着防具......伊雷妮确实让我想起了一个讨厌的家伙。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"curtain","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":301},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":304},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":305},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不管是在炎国，还是叙拉古，每次遇见那个人，我都会变得很倒霉。","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......原来是这样。","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"柳德米拉，我不想去问那些乌萨斯的故事到底是你听来的还是你的亲身经历，咱们也没必要争到底谁的人生更倒霉一点......","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"就当是倒霉蛋们不期而会了吧，哈哈。","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮那丫头总说，再倒霉的人也会被生活眷顾的，只是会迟一些。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉没有说话，车转过一个路口，她随意地扭头看了窗外一眼——","id":321},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":326},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1","id":334},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":335},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"那是——","id":339},{"type":"dialog","id":340},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","id":342},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":345},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"0.11","id":348},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":349,"musicid":3},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.12","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tyrexplosion","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":352},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","id":353},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":354},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"该死——方向盘怎么突然之间不听使唤了——","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"当心，索默尔，那边有辆车——","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","id":360},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","id":363},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","channel":"1","id":364},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":365},{"type":"playsound","key":"$glass","channel":"2","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_planeshake","channel":"3","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"真狼，红终于找到你了。","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"红不会放过你。","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂，没看到吗？你的刀和我的箭扎爆了他们的轮胎，不救人吗？","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呀。","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"阿涅塞，你说得对，狩猎的时候不该分心。","id":382},{"type":"curtain","id":383},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":386},{"type":"bg","duration":"6","from":"1","to":"0.3","id":387},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":388},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-30","yFrom":"-30","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","duration":"3","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus","channel":"2","id":392},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","x":"10","y":"10","id":393},{"type":"backgroundtween","xTo":"15","yTo":"5","duration":"3","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":395},{"type":"backgroundtween","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","duration":"2","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","id":396},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":398},{"type":"char","duration":"2","from":"0.5","to":"0.3","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","duration":"0.5","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":401},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.5","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"300,0","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉觉得自己头痛欲裂。","id":405},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":406},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","id":407},{"type":"text","text":"她奋力扯开安全带，推开车门，从座椅上跌落。脸挨着地面的瞬间，她看见熟悉的红色身影消失在路口。","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"char","duration":"1","from":"0.3","to":"0","id":411},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0.5","to":"0","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"咳咳......","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"晕眩感还没有从脑海消失，她来不及确认现场的情况，来不及看看索默尔有没有事——愤怒，一直以来的愤怒像是潮水一样席卷而来。","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"真倒霉啊——怎么又是你？！","id":419},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"35","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#8$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你这个——该死的狼崽子！","id":422},{"type":"dialog","id":423},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.7","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"350,0","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":430},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":431},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":432},{"type":"char","duration":"3","from":"0","to":"0","id":433},{"type":"bg","duration":"3","from":"0","to":"0","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"false","text":"","id":435},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","channel":"1","volume":"0.7","id":436},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","text":"","id":438},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","channel":"2","volume":"1","id":439},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"false","text":"","id":440},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","channel":"3","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","text":"","id":443},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"1","x":"100","y":"150","id":444},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","channel":"3","id":445},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"1","x":"200","y":"50","id":447},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing6","channel":"4","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"过去在叙拉古，我处理过比这更棘手的情况，同时动手的人也更多。","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"但无一例外，躺下的绝不会是我。","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"别将人与兽群等同，你狩猎野兽的那套技巧，在我面前没用。","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"你大可继续试试。当然，你也是，“红”。","id":455},{"type":"dialog","id":456},{"type":"charslot","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":458},{"type":"delay","time":"1.51","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"......","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_144_red_7#1","duration":"1","id":462},{"type":"delay","time":"1.51","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#8$2","focus":"r","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"子月","text":"我会找到你的。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4014_lunacu_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_144_red_7#5","focus":"l","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红的刀，需要更锋利......","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_char_144_red_5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":470},{"type":"charslot","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#8$1","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"来吧。","id":473},{"type":"dialog","id":474},{"type":"charslot","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4014_lunacu_1#8$2","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":477},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,300","duration":"0.51","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,300","duration":"0.51","id":480},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","id":481},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":482},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":483},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#7$1","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"......？","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4026_vulpis_1#2$1","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"英格丽","text":"你们没法躲太久的。瓦古欠我的答案，我已经等不了了。","id":487},{"type":"dialog","id":488},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":489},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":491},{"type":"dialog","id":492},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":493},{"type":"charslot","id":494},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":495},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":496},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","duration":"1","id":498},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"突然冒出来的沃尔珀，红失败了。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_exsheath","id":503},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.4","block":"false","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#5","id":506},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-250,0","duration":"0.3","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":507},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ftrub","id":508},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":509},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":510},{"type":"charslot","id":511},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","id":512},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"该死的狼崽子！","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我终于找到你了，这次你又想若无其事地走掉吗？","id":515},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_144_red_7#1","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......","id":517,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"怎么又是你？！","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_char_144_red_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":519},{"type":"charslot","id":520},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.2","block":"false","id":521},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","id":522},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spear","id":523},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.2","id":524},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","delay":"0.3","id":525},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":526},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","id":527},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","id":528},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metalcollar","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.3","id":529},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉再次挥刀，被红灵巧地闪过，紧接着自己的背上挨了重重一脚，手被擒住，刀掉落在了地上。","id":530},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":531},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","id":532},{"type":"text","text":"等到反应过来的时候，她已经被狠狠地压在了地面上。","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"呃，呜——","id":534},{"type":"dialog","id":535},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":536},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_6_18.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","x":"150","y":"-100","id":537},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":538},{"type":"text","text":"脸与地面摩擦的剧烈痛感在一瞬间唤醒了柳德米拉的回忆——","id":539},{"type":"text","text":"龙门的小巷里，自己也是被这个可恶的狼崽子像这般制服，几乎丧失反抗的能力。","id":540},{"type":"text","text":"一模一样的姿势，一模一样的痛感。","id":541},{"type":"dialog","id":542},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":543},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"嘶，我的胳膊——放开我，*乌萨斯粗口**叙拉古粗口*！","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你这人渣，在龙门，我终于能够报仇的时候，为什么你要挡在凯尔希面前？！","id":546},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"老师她明明没法再战斗了，为什么你还是要杀她？！","id":548},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"为什么你要一次又一次出现在我面前？！","id":549},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","id":550},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"为什么我，杀不了你？！","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"（郁闷地呲牙）","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"......红记得你。","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红是猎狼人，你不是真狼，红没有必要杀你。","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"凯尔希说过，我们不该杀死一条没家的鬣狗。你很痛苦，凯尔希不希望红杀你。","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":556},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"外婆还在等红。","id":557},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"红没有时间耗在这里，红还要去找最后的真狼。","id":558},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红","text":"别再妨碍红。红已经离开了罗德岛，红已经没有听凯尔希的话了......","id":559},{"type":"dialog","id":560},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":561},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":562},{"type":"dialog","id":563},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":564},{"type":"charslot","id":565},{"type":"image","id":566},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":567},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":568},{"type":"text","text":"身穿红色连帽衫的鲁珀没有一刻停留，转瞬间消失在了巷子深处。","id":569},{"type":"text","text":"柳德米拉没有起身，她躺在地面上，捂住自己几乎脱臼的胳膊，等待疼痛和屈辱将自己淹没。","id":570},{"type":"text","text":"她突然回想起了索默尔说的话。","id":571},{"type":"dialog","id":572},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":573},{"type":"charslot","id":574},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":575},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":576},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":577},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":578},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":579},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":580},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":581},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"就当是倒霉蛋们不期而会了吧，哈哈。","id":582},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":583},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮那丫头总说，再倒霉的人也会被生活眷顾的，只是会迟一些。","id":584},{"type":"dialog","id":585},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":586},{"type":"charslot","id":587},{"type":"curtain","id":588},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":589},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":590},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":591},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":592},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"索默尔，真的吗？","id":593},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":594},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"索默尔......对了，索默尔......","id":595},{"type":"dialog","id":596},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":597},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","duration":"1.5","posfrom":"0,-100","posto":"0,0","id":598},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":599},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"6","times":"40","duration":"0.5","id":600},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":601},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","id":602},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"该死，只顾着追这个可恶的狼崽子，忘了索默尔还在那辆车上......","id":603},{"type":"dialog","id":604},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":605},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":606},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":607},{"type":"image","id":608},{"type":"charslot","id":609}],"characters":["索默尔","柳德米拉","卡车司机","家族成员","卡车司机A","卡车司机B","？？？","英格丽","子月","红"]}